      "data": {
        "label": "EXAMPLE — C4 Component: Notification Service\n\nIllustrates: the third and final level of the C4 drill-down (Context → Container → Component) — this container's own internal structure, one level deeper than the Container diagram.\nPersona: the same technical/solution architect on the modernization task force.\n\nColor key: blue = internal components (matches this container's own color at Container level). Purple = the human actor this service ultimately sends to. Also-blue box on the left = the container that calls this one, shown for context only.\n\nPart of the Meridian Rail example gallery — epic 0022 (docs/planning/epics/0022-example-diagram-gallery.md)."
      }
    },
